Hindi → Pure Hindi tone
Hinglish → Conversational, natural mix (no forced blending)

AUDIENCE PROFILES
Students
Entrepreneurs
Creators
Custom

Hook and body tone adapt accordingly.
EMOTIONAL INTENSITY SCALE
1 – Calm
2 – Motivational
3 – Strong
4 – Aggressive
5 – Custom
Hook sharpness + pacing change based on level.

CTA ENGINE (Optional Toggle)
If enabled: CTA must align with theme.
Options: Follow for more
Subscribe
Comment
Save
Custom
CTA must not feel forced or salesy.

SCRIPT QUALITY SCORE 
After generation, show:
Hook Strength Score 6.7/10
Retention Potential 6.4/10
Emotional Intensity Match 2/10
CTA Alignment 3/10

This builds product credibility.

Example Geneterate using this formula 
Topic: Debate between Modi and Dhruv Rathee
Duration: 1 minute
Language: Hinglish
CTA: No

HOOK (Curiosity + Pattern Interrupt blend)
Agar Modi aur Dhruv Rathee ek hi stage par debate karein… toh asli jeet kiski hogi?

BODY
Socho ek taraf Prime Minister Narendra Modi experienced political leader, strong public speaker, 

Doosri taraf Dhruv Rathee  YouTube commentator, fact-based breakdowns, aur digital audience par strong influence.

Modi ka strength hai political experience, governance decisions, aur emotional public appeal.
Dhruv ka strength hai research presentation, statistics aur structured argument building.

Debate interesting tab hoti jab: One side policy aur vision defend kare, Aur doosri side data se question kare.
Public reaction bhi divided hoti Traditional supporters vs digital generation viewers.
Ultimately, debate sirf personality ka nahi hota, It’s about narrative control vs analytical breakdown.

Aur real winner? Wohi jiska argument audience ko zyada convincing lage.


